flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b8babe,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef friction fill:#f6f7f7,stroke:#3a3e44,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef broken fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c4362b,stroke-width:2px,color:#c4362b;
  S1["1. Folder actions, Lock with a password: Password,<br/>Repeat password, a Close button, and 6 px below<br/>the second field the note 'Use at least 8<br/>characters. Links in this folder stay out of<br/>sight everywhere until you unlock it. The<br/>password cannot be recovered.'<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. Fewer than 8 characters, two that differ, or<br/>one too easy to guess are named under the<br/>fields: 'Use at least 8 characters.', 'The<br/>passwords do not match.', 'This password is too<br/>easy to guess. Choose another one.'<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. Lock goes back to the Dashboard with 'Folder<br/>locked'; the sidebar shows the name with a lock<br/>and no count.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. A locked folder is gone from search, Recent and<br/>the counts.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. A click on it opens Unlock; a wrong password<br/>says 'Wrong password'; the right one opens it<br/>for 10 minutes.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. The lock, unlock and remove lock dialogs have a<br/>Close button in the head, 44 by 44; Escape and<br/>a tap outside close them too.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. Unlocked, the folder actions offer Relock now<br/>and Remove lock, which asks the app password.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S8["8. On the phone the lock dialog note sits 6 px<br/>below the Repeat password field, as on the<br/>desktop.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
